le_cargoruqsat_title:'E-Queue at Border',profile_cargoruqsat_subtitle:'CarGoRuqsat \xb7 coming soon',cargoruqsat_page_title:'E-Queue at Border',cargoruqsat_page_status:'In development \xb7 expected in 2026',cargoruqsat_page_what_title:'What is it?',cargoruqsat_page_what_body:'CarGoRuqsat is the Kazakhstan state automated e-queue system for trucks crossing the border. Supports 50+ checkpoints including Dostyk-Alashankou, Nur Zholy-Khorgos, Kalzhat-Dulaty, Maikapchagay-Zimunai.',cargoruqsat_page_benefits_title:'Why drivers want this',cargoruqsat_page_benefits_body:'\u2022 Book a queue slot directly from UrTruck\n\u2022 Less idle time at the border\n\u2022 Automatic document verification\n\u2022 Transparent queue, no bribes\n\u2022 Push notification one hour before your slot',cargoruqsat_page_when_title:'When?',cargoruqsat_page_when_body:'UrTruck has received official approval from the JSC "Information & Accounting Center" for integration via the Smart Bridge platform (CargoRuqsatAppsServiceSync). Information security certification takes 3-6 months. Expected launch \u2014 Q4 2026.',cargoruqsat_page_open_official:'Open official portal',cargoruqsat_live_title:'Border checkpoint load',cargoruqsat_live_empty:'No data yet. Pull down to refresh.',cargoruqsat_live_error:'Failed to load. Check your connection and pull down.',cargoruqsat_live_updated:'Updated',cargoruqsat_live_trucks_short:'trucks in queue',cargoruqsat_live_hours_short:'h',cargoruqsat_booking_title:'Attach CarGoRuqsat booking',cargoruqsat_booking_hint:'After booking on cgr.qoldau.kz, enter the assigned booking number here \u2014 we will track its status and send you push updates.',cargoruqsat_booking_placeholder:'Booking number (e.g. 555-XYZ-2026)',cargoruqsat_booking_submit:'Attach to trip',cargoruqsat_booking_invalid_title:'Check the number',cargoruqsat_booking_invalid_body:'Booking number must be at least 3 characters long.',cargoruqsat_booking_success_title:'Booking attached',cargoruqsat_booking_success_bod